  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products: Hyggelight | The Growing Candle creates cozy, sustainable candles with a second life. Each candle is hand-poured into a reusable ceramic vessel and includes a seed-infused label that can be planted to grow wildflowers after the candle is finished.<br>• What makes us different: Every Growing Candle transforms from a beautifully scented candle into a planter. It’s a thoughtful gift, home decor piece, and sustainable product all in one — perfect for eco-conscious shoppers, plant lovers, wellness buyers, and seasonal gifting.<br>• How affiliates can earn: Affiliates can earn commission by promoting our candles, gift bundles, seasonal launches, and special offers through social media, blogs, gift guides, product reviews, email lists, and lifestyle content.<br>• How to promote us: Create cozy lifestyle content, candle reviews, gift guides, unboxings, plantable label demos, or before-and-after content showing the candle becoming a planter. Strong angles include “a candle that turns into flowers” and “the gift that keeps growing.”<br>• Other information: Hyggelight is a Certified B Corp brand with a unique product story, beautiful packaging, and strong visual appeal. We’re looking for creators, bloggers, and affiliates who love cozy living, sustainable gifting, home fragrance, and thoughtful products.</p></div></div>",
